<author id="324763">marto</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;So in case you haven't been following the conference, [https://www.perl.com/article/announcing-perl-7/|Perl 7 has been announced.]  To quote [brian_d_foy], a little &lt;i&gt;&lt;strong&gt;tl/dr&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/i&gt;: &lt;i&gt;'Perl 7 is v5.32 with different settings. Your code should work if it’s not a mess. Expect a user release within a year.'&lt;/i&gt;, but you should probably just read the whole post, since, you know, details. Also [https://leanpub.com/preparing_for_perl7|Preparing for Perl 7].&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Update:&lt;/b&gt; s/[chromatic]/[brian_d_foy]/. Thanks [1nickt].&lt;/p&gt;
